BT /F2 14 Tf 54.00 225.00 Td (Background And Objectives) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 201.00 Td (StatsChat-KE uses a retrieval-and-generation architecture. It indexes KNBS publications,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 188.00 Td (retrieves relevant content for a user question, and asks a language model to produce an answer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 175.00 Td (grounded in that retrieved context.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 159.00 Td (Before this work, the system could answer questions, but it was difficult to say how reliable it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 146.00 Td (was. The project did not have a mature automated test suite for the RAG behavior, and it did not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 133.00 Td (have an audited benchmark that could support a defensible accuracy claim. Local and cloud modes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 120.00 Td (also used different retrieval behavior. That made it hard to know whether errors came from) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 107.00 Td (retrieval, the language model, the evidence data, or the evaluator.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 288.00 28 Td (Page 1) Tj ET
