BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 738.00 Td (The work described in this report had three practical objectives. First, build automated tests) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 725.00 Td (so the system could be changed safely. Second, create a reliable audited accuracy benchmark with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 712.00 Td (both answerable and unanswerable questions. Third, improve the retrieval and guardrail behavior) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 699.00 Td (until the measured performance was strong enough to support a controlled rollout.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 54.00 673.00 Td (QA Curation And Benchmark Quality) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 649.00 Td (The benchmark was not a simple pass-through of the initial QA material available from KNBS. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 636.00 Td (initial material had serious issues for automated accuracy evaluation. Some rows had missing or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 623.00 Td (weak evidence fields, some questions were ambiguous, and some answer/source links were difficult) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 610.00 Td (to verify. In some cases, document IDs or evidence locations were not specific enough to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 597.00 Td (evaluate whether the retrieval system had found the right source.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 581.00 Td (The project team therefore reviewed, amended, and extended the QA material. Existing rows were) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 568.00 Td (clarified where needed, evidence locations were aligned to source text, and new rows were added.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 555.00 Td (The team also defined the benchmark structure needed for evaluation: each answerable row needed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 542.00 Td (a question, a golden answer, a relevant document identifier, an evidence location, and a source) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 529.00 Td (text span. Unanswerable rows needed to be marked explicitly while leaving gold/evidence fields) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 516.00 Td (blank. This curation was essential. Without reliable ground truth, a high or low accuracy number) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 503.00 Td (would have been difficult to interpret.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 487.00 Td (The current audited benchmark contains 74 rows: 61 answerable questions and 13 unanswerable) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 474.00 Td (questions. The unanswerable questions are important because they test whether the system refuses) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 461.00 Td (out-of-scope requests rather than inventing statistics.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 54.00 435.00 Td (Architecture Improvements) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 411.00 Td (The benchmark showed that overall accuracy alone was not enough. The system could fail in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 398.00 Td (several ways: it could retrieve the wrong report edition, find the right report but the wrong) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 385.00 Td (page, refuse an answerable question, or answer from an older near-duplicate source.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 369.00 Td (The retrieval architecture was improved to address these problems. The system now uses stronger) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 356.00 Td (reranking, report-family recognition, temporal edition selection, and page-aware context) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 343.00 Td (selection. In practical terms, the retrieval stage no longer relies only on raw vector) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 330.00 Td (similarity. It now also uses knowledge about report families, dates, months, quarters, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 317.00 Td (report editions. This means that questions about specific families such as CPI bulletins,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 304.00 Td (Economic Surveys, KDHS, Facts and Figures, Statistical Abstracts, FinAccess, Construction Input) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 291.00 Td (Price Indices, and Leading Economic Indicators are routed more reliably to the correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 278.00 Td (publications.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 262.00 Td (One experiment was deliberately abandoned. An early page-selection approach inserted many pages) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 249.00 Td (from the top document into the global ranking pool. It improved page-hit metrics but disrupted) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 236.00 Td (document ranking and did not improve accuracy. The final design keeps document ranking stable) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 223.00 Td (and improves page selection only within already selected documents. This is a better) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 210.00 Td (architecture for long reports.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 194.00 Td (The local and cloud APIs now share the same retrieval behavior. The intended difference is the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 181.00 Td (language model used for answer generation. This makes local/cloud comparisons more meaningful) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 168.00 Td (because retrieval is no longer a hidden source of divergence.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 54.00 142.00 Td (Testing Infrastructure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 118.00 Td (Automated tests were added across unit, integration, and end-to-end layers. This was a major) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 105.00 Td (part of the work: the test suite was built to give the team confidence that retrieval changes,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 92.00 Td (API changes, evaluator changes, and pipeline changes could be made without silently breaking) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 79.00 Td (existing behavior. The latest full test run completed successfully with 231 tests passing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 288.00 28 Td (Page 2) Tj ET
