BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 738.00 Td (The tests cover retrieval helpers, temporal parsing, report-family recognition, API endpoints,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 725.00 Td (guardrails, evaluator logic, feedback endpoints, health checks, and end-to-end search flows.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 712.00 Td (This test coverage made the retrieval refactors safer and allowed the team to reject changes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 699.00 Td (that improved one metric while damaging another.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 54.00 673.00 Td (Evaluation Methodology) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 649.00 Td (The evaluator measures answer quality, retrieval quality, and refusal quality. This distinction) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 636.00 Td (is central to interpreting the results because a RAG system can fail in different ways: it can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 623.00 Td (retrieve the wrong evidence, retrieve the right evidence but synthesize the wrong answer, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 610.00 Td (answer when it should refuse.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 594.00 Td (Accuracy is measured row by row against the audited benchmark. For answerable questions, a row) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 581.00 Td (is correct when the predicted answer matches the audited golden answer. For unanswerable) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 568.00 Td (questions, a row is correct when the system refuses or returns no substantive answer. The report) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 555.00 Td (therefore separates answerable accuracy, unanswerable accuracy, overall accuracy, answer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 542.00 Td (coverage, and false answer rate.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 526.00 Td (Retrieval metrics measure whether the system returned the right document and page before answer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 513.00 Td (generation. The report distinguishes raw FAISS proxy retrieval from the final API pipeline,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 500.00 Td (because the production pipeline includes reranking, temporal handling, report-family routing,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 487.00 Td (and page selection. The detailed formulas and scoring rules used for these metrics are included) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 474.00 Td (in Appendix 2.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 54.00 448.00 Td (Results Over Time) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 424.00 Td (The evaluation process revealed an important overfitting risk. The original 37-row benchmark) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 411.00 Td (eventually reached high accuracy, but when 24 new answerable questions from under-tested report) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 398.00 Td (families were added, answerable accuracy initially dropped to 48 out of 61. This showed that the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 385.00 Td (original set was not representative enough.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 369.00 Td (After targeted retrieval improvements, performance recovered on the expanded benchmark. The best) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 356.00 Td (run reached 57 correct answerable rows out of 61 and retained perfect refusal behavior on the 13) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 343.00 Td (unanswerable rows.) Tj ET
